OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA grey and wet start to the
OL,6,Fweekend, with outbreaks of heavy rain
OL,7,Fpossible throughout the day, only
OL,8,Fstarting to clear by the evening.
OL,9,FStrong winds, especially along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FClear
OL,13,Fstart to Sunday, blustery showers
OL,14,Fdevelop later. Cloudy periods and
OL,15,Fwindy on Monday, with rain across
OL,16,FYorkshire Dales. Grey and wet on
OL,17,FTuesday. Turning noticeably milder
OL,18,Ffrom Monday onwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
